WEBVTT

00:26:30.290 --> 00:26:32.624
I wondered if Jane thinks
high-quality connections

00:26:32.648 --> 00:26:35.016
might be an antidote
to loneliness at work.

00:26:35.040 --> 00:26:37.689
JD: I mean, loneliness,
as I understand it,

00:26:37.713 --> 00:26:41.016
is really about the absence of connection.

00:26:41.040 --> 00:26:46.993
I think it could be an antidote
to part of the problem of loneliness.

00:26:48.251 --> 00:26:50.321
AG: Loneliness is a complex issue,

00:26:50.345 --> 00:26:53.566
but there are some simple steps
you can take that might make a dent,

00:26:53.590 --> 00:26:57.133
even if -- and maybe especially if --
you're working remotely.

00:26:58.030 --> 00:27:01.296
Our highest-quality connections
are often with friends at work,